TMF SKU lineage contract evidence
branch: codex/tmf-webbing-management
head: ed9daa9c1c75fccadd8eb0901ec1876bbee41928
scope: MAT-003, MAT-004, MAT-007

normal:
- A + 19-4052 + blue + P001 => A-19-4052-BLUE-P001
- A + 19-4052 + blue + empty pattern => A-19-4052-BLUE
- TMF-W20MM + 本白 + empty pantone/pattern => TMF-W20MM-本白

boundary:
- empty color is rejected
- length tokens 50CM/70CM and tip tokens METAL/PLASTIC/SILICONE are not accepted as SKU dimensions and do not appear in generated identity
- different webbing widths or rope diameters remain separate material/SPU records before SKU creation

inventory identity:
- permanent SKU: SPU + color identity + optional pantone + optional pattern
- production-specific length, garment-size usage, tip method/specification stay in WebbingSpecification, demand detail, output batch and package identity
